{"product_id":"midnight-ember-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Resin Midnight Ember (Butt only)","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [\u0026amp;:has([data-writing-block])\u0026gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eBold, sophisticated, and meticulously handcrafted, the \u003cstrong\u003eMidnight Ember\u003c\/strong\u003e is a striking fusion of natural beauty and modern craftsmanship. Built from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt features dramatic long points accented with \u003cstrong\u003estabilized burl wood\u003c\/strong\u003e and deep \u003cstrong\u003eblack resin\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a design rich in depth, contrast, and character. A beautifully figured \u003cstrong\u003erosewood butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e adds warmth and elegance, while the \u003cstrong\u003epremium Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e provides a comfortable, secure grip for confident play.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Midnight Ember showcases the precision, artistry, and attention to detail that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft for competition or displayed as part of a premium collection, it is a cue that commands attention both on and off the table.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccent Materials:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stabilized Burl Wood \u0026amp; Black Resin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rosewood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDistinctive materials. Timeless craftsmanship. Designed to perform, built to be admired.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e